E", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 52788706, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 52788745, "text": "<ol>\n<li>Put the banana (or chocolate) on the plate.</li>\n<li>Take it in turns to roll the die.</li>\n<li>If you roll a six, put on the hat and gloves and use the knife and fork to cut up and eat slices of banana (or squares of chocolate).</li>\n<li>The other player keeps rolling the die. If they roll a six, swap over.</li>\n<li>Keep going until the banana (or chocolate) is gone!</li>\n</ol>", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 4, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 52788706, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}]